       "labelKind": "preferred",
       "inScope": true,
       "score": 12,
       "provenance": "asr-terminology"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "index": 37,
     "startSeconds": 1126.29,
     "endSeconds": 1151.68,
     "textPreview": "是一个非常巧妙的系统架构设计怎么个巧妙方你想普通的反馈控制就像是你走在街上被雨淋",
     "canonical": []
    },
    {
     "index": 38,
     "startSeconds": 1151.68,
     "endSeconds": 1177.48,
     "textPreview": "门的瞬间就把伞搭好连淋湿的机会都不给反馈控制器在那边淋着雨抱怨潜窥控制器已经在一",
     "canonical": []
    },
    {
     "index": 39,
     "startSeconds": 1177.48,
     "endSeconds": 1202.6,
     "textPreview": "提图里低通率的物理现实从超前效正如赛车过弯一般的提前量计算到ZN和IMC在黑和与",
     "canonical": [
      {
       "canonicalId": "ctkg:domainconcept:c2edca0b60ba1ce87eb78146",
       "matchedLabel": "前馈控制",
       "labelKind": "preferred",
       "inScope": true,
       "score": 16,
       "provenance": "asr-terminology"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "index": 40,
     "startSeconds": 1202.6,
     "endSeconds": 1265.0,
     "textPreview": "付动态世界的生存指南呢是的每一道繁琐的拉普拉斯变换背后其实都是为了让物理世界变得",
     "canonical": [
      {
       "canonicalId": "ctc:modeling-9ba52fe3ff16aed315b747c8",
       "matchedLabel": "拉普拉斯变换",
       "labelKind": "preferred",
       "inScope": false,
       "score": 12,
       "provenance": "asr-terminology"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "index": 41,
     "startSeconds": 1265.0,
     "endSeconds": 1277.8,
     "textPreview": "个即将被非线性AI算法接管的动态世界里你认为今天学的这些经典的PID和拉普拉斯变",
     "canonical": [
      {
       "canonicalId": "ctc:modeling-9ba52fe3ff16aed315b747c8",
       "matchedLabel": "拉普拉斯变换",
       "labelKind": "preferred",
